    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>1st-level Shadow feature</em></p><p>As a bonus action, you can choose one creature that failed a saving throw from one of your priest spells or abilities this turn. That creature, and all creatures of your choice within 5 feet of them take [[/damage 1d6 psychic]] damage. Any charmed or frightened creatures who take this damage takes an additional [[/damage 1d6 psychic]] damage.</p><p>You can use this bonus action a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p>",
